        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sam Roberts, Kathleen Hanna\n- Bands: Bikini Kill, Le Tigre\n- Songs: \"Without a Map\"\n- Companies: Universal Canada\n\nFacts:\n- Kathleen Hanna was the lead singer of Bikini Kill in the early-to-mid-1990s.\n- Kathleen Hanna fronted Le Tigre in the late 1990s and early 2000s.\n- Bikini Kill released two full-length albums, several EPs, and two compilations before disbanding in 1997.\n- Sam Roberts was born on October 2, 1974.\n- Sam Roberts is a Canadian rock singer-songwriter.\n- Sam Roberts has been signed to Universal Canada since 2002.\n- Sam Roberts has released six albums.\n- \"Without a Map\" is a song by Canadian musician Sam Roberts.",
